# Make a copy of a book

Make a copy to try out a big change, or to start a new book from one you have already set up.

1. On the [Books]{.ui} screen, point at the book and click the `···` button beside its title.
2. Click [Duplicate]{.ui}.
3. Type a *Title* for the copy, or keep the one suggested.
4. Click [Duplicate]{.ui}.

The copy appears under [Your books]{.ui}. Changes to one book do not affect the other.
